{"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/init(realm:asURI:pat:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/asURI","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/pat","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/realm"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s8SendableP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"metadata":{"title":"UmaChallenger","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK13UmaChallengerV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UmaChallenger","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"UmaChallenger"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/umachallenger"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UmaChallenger","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Hand one to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamGuards\/requireAccess(_:resource:scope:umaChallenge:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and a denial stops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"being a bare 403: the guard mints a fresh permission ticket for the pair the caller lacked and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attaches it to the thrown "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AuthzError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", so the framework adapter can return it as a header and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a UMA-aware client knows where to go for authority instead of only being told “no”."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Opt-in, and deliberately so.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Emitting a challenge means minting a credential — a wire call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the Protection API, and a live ticket, produced on a path the caller did not explicitly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request. A guard that did that on every denial by default would turn each unauthorized request","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"into a Protection API call, which is a denial-of-service amplifier pointed at your own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"authorization server. So it happens only where an application asked for it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Failure is not escalation."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" If minting fails — the PAT expired, the Protection API is down,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the resource declares none of the requested scopes — the denial still surfaces as an ordinary","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AuthzError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" without a challenge. A caller who was going to be refused is refused either way;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"letting a Protection API outage turn a deny into a 503 would hand the outage a second","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consequence, and letting it turn into an allow would be a security bug.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A configured "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WWW-Authenticate: UMA"},{"type":"text","text":" challenge emitter (CONTRACT.md §20.3, emit half)."}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","title":"AxiamSDK","abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/UmaChallenger":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger","title":"UmaChallenger","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/umachallenger","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"UmaChallenger"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A configured "},{"code":"WWW-Authenticate: UMA","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" challenge emitter (CONTRACT.md §20.3, emit half)."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"UmaChallenger"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/umaDiscover()":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"umaDiscover","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17Uma2ConfigurationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Uma2Configuration"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/umaDiscover()","abstract":[{"code":"GET \/.well-known\/uma2-configuration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (§20.1) — fetch the UMA discovery document."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/umadiscover()","title":"umaDiscover()","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AuthzError":{"title":"AuthzError","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AuthzError","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AuthzError"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Authorization failure (§2). Carries a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"message"},{"type":"text","text":" and, when the server provided them,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the denied "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"action"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resourceID"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/authzerror","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AuthzError"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/UmaChallenger/pat":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/pat","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"pat"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","text":"Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/umachallenger\/pat","title":"pat","abstract":[{"text":"A Protection API Token: a ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"client-credentials","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" token carrying the "},{"code":"uma_protection","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" scope"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(§20.2 rule 1). A user token cannot stand in — a minted ticket is bound to the "},{"code":"client_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that minted it."}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/UmaChallenger/realm":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"realm","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"realm","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/realm","abstract":[{"text":"The protection realm named in the header.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/umachallenger\/realm"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/UmaChallenger/asURI":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/umachallenger\/asuri","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"asURI","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"asURI","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/asURI","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The authorization server the caller should redeem the ticket at — normally this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deployment’s issuer, read from "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/umaDiscover()"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than concatenated by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hand, for the same reason §12.3 rule 6 gives."}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/UmaChallenger/init(realm:asURI:pat:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaChallenger\/init(realm:asURI:pat:)","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"realm","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"asURI","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pat","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","text":"Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">)","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/umachallenger\/init(realm:asuri:pat:)","title":"init(realm:asURI:pat:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamGuards/requireAccess(_:resource:scope:umaChallenge:)":{"title":"requireAccess(_:resource:scope:umaChallenge:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamGuards\/requireAccess(_:resource:scope:umaChallenge:)","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"require_access(action, resource[, scope])"},{"type":"text","text":" (§11): the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"authenticated caller","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" must pass"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an AXIAM authorization check. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"subject_id"},{"type":"text","text":" is the end user’s id (§11.2 rule 2), not the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"application’s service-account session."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamguards\/requireaccess(_:resource:scope:umachallenge:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requireAccess","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resource","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scope","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"umaChallenge","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UmaChallenger","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13UmaChallengerV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxiamGuardHandler","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK0A12GuardHandlera","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s8SendableP"}}}